{
  "answer": "**答案:2 个元音。**\n\n这位歌手是 Amy Winehouse。她唱了《Rehab》,并在 2008 年 6 月 27 日的伦敦海德公园演唱会上为 Nelson Mandela 的 90 岁生日献唱。Nelson 里的元音是 e 和 o,共 2 个。\n\n有一点没查实:搜索结果里只有一处说《Rehab》拿了 Song of the Year,另一处说它拿的是 Record of the Year。我没有查格莱美官网核对。不过演唱会这条线索足以确定是 Winehouse 和 Mandela。\n\nSources:\n- [London Rocks for Nelson Mandela (ABC News)](https://abcnews.go.com/Entertainment/london-rocks-nelson-mandela/story?id=5268443)\n- [Singer Amy Winehouse Takes the Stage at Nelson Mandela's Birthday Show (Fox News)](https://www.foxnews.com/story/singer-amy-winehouse-takes-the-stage-at-nelson-mandelas-birthday-show.amp)\n- [Amy Winehouse (Simple Wikipedia)](https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Amy_Winehouse)",
